Hi, friend!Here you can see an old apocalyptic (or post-apocalyptic) destroyed building. It is a High Quality game ready (Low Poly) asset which you can freely use in any (commercial/non-commercial) purposes without any additional fees. You can use it in a project of any type whether it is a game/movie or just a visualisation. The asset includes the building itself & some inner parts with cool PBR materials.And remember: You(game character) can come inside this house!
Speaking about the polycount, it is quite a low number for such a photorealistic asset.
Total polycount: 16.207 faces! 
SEPARATE MESHES:

  - Building itself - 11.117 polygons;

  - Air Conditioners 113 polygons;

  - Advertisement Banner - 1.128 polygons;

  - Empty Advertisement Banner - 1.064 polygons;

  - Garbage Type 1 - 284 polygons;

  - Garbage Type 2 - 162 polygons;

  - Vending mashines - 602 polygons;

  - Wardrobes - 304 polygons;

  - Windows - 136 polygons;

  - Presentational Plane - 1 polygon.

TEXTURES:Main mesh (Just a building):

  - Albedo/Diffuse - 4K (4096 X 4096);

  - Roughness/Detail Albedo - 4K (4096 X 4096);

  - Normal Map - 4K (4096 X 4096);Details (Inner parts, windows, garbage etc.):

  - Albedo/Diffuse - 4K (4096 X 4096);

  - Roughness/Detail Albedo - 4K (4096 X 4096);

  - Normal Map - 4K (4096 X 4096);

*Textures are packaged in to RAR archive.
FEATURES:

  - Separate meshes, easy to animate;

  - All of the popular file formats (FBX, OBJ, DAE, BLEND, X3D, STL);

  - File names (textures & meshes) are simple to understand, no mess in files;

  - Stylish design;

  - Smart polycount;

  - Clean topology;

  - Realistic shading;

  - PBR texture maps;

  - Athmospheric look;

  - Royalty-free licence.

ADVANTAGES BRIEFLY:Intelligent file naming, no mess in 3D file - no lamps/planes/cameras/other trash. All meshes are centered by the world origin, has normal scale. No flipped normals.
RECOMMENDATION:To use all or the advantages of this pack, download my other assets (they are of a similar style and quality). You can get them from my artist's page for free or for a good price.
NOTE 0:The windows mesh was made a separate part in case your game/render engine didn't recognize blender's transparency so you could easily remove it and place a standard glass object on top of the table or just customize its transparensy in your dev software.
NOTE 1:it is important to note I am the only creator of all models in this pack and I ALLOW using them in any commercial and non-commercial purposes.
NOTE 2:If you have any questions/suggestions or issues with the asset, feel free to write me on my e-mail or use the comment section (or direct messaging).I am always ready to help you!
Best wishes,Your 3D artist,Andriy Bobchuk.
